              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-7c60a438-6cbb-42b3-a627-3b4163bc65e1">
              <lg xml:id="m-7e625516-e0c2-4d29-bceb-4e5d2e834679">
                <l xml:id="m-54a33e54-1432-44f8-b788-b8ddfe83a5da" facs="#m-15d59be6-4843-497d-8e93-756c2ede9cda" label="ambiguous">November 30</l><l xml:id="m-f39e61f8-d5b4-4e0a-bef9-8da609f57ab0" facs="#m-1dfab950-9c3f-4429-8d01-54c09603dbfb" label="ambiguous">1307</l><l xml:id="m-b2262dc4-2ccb-47b4-b06f-4e75cf8f2200" facs="#m-ed781e1d-d9be-42ed-a1ac-dbe9badfcf91" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-d25b13f4-040e-4606-8be5-39172c7770b1" facs="#m-8824549b-b283-4ce9-a205-ffd4714cac0d" label="lyrics-like">NUmpsimus Dómine, divína my-I tuis Sanctis ad glóriam, ita nobis,</l><l xml:id="m-222f87d5-fc8e-4b75-9865-017bc3b61ce2" facs="#m-f8356c03-63e7-40c6-95e5-2d1b58f4aaff" label="lyrics-like">O stéria, beáti Andréae Apóstoli ] quaésumus, ad véniam prodése</l><l xml:id="m-23852635-87ff-4d16-83af-2ede69106a97" facs="#m-38b5c6e1-13a8-4905-b931-5e06e1c1254c" label="lyrics-like">festivitáte laetántes; quae, sicut lperficias. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b52366b4-d477-4ff7-a466-92cef1f5cada" facs="#m-c4e5e5b4-878a-4567-a1f4-9cee42f838a1" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-8ee5ab35-e43f-4b55-abde-841cc23fea63" facs="#m-151014c4-2c9c-483b-8d1c-2131c58feac4" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Andréas Christi fámulus. D. 1308.</l><l xml:id="m-0be040ce-8216-457e-b5a6-1e030467e3ce" facs="#m-79406506-82a9-49c5-8314-4f51e6c1e680" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-53217012-d7a9-4936-ba57-846fac2b7eb4" facs="#m-805548cc-1b34-4e9f-bfb6-346540103495" label="ambiguous">Rom. 10. c.</l><l xml:id="m-e18126e1-ffc8-4cf3-abc5-be4b7dfc6308" facs="#m-9f967758-4459-4649-b1d3-9931eebdc2d2" label="lyrics-like">ON enim est distinctio Judaéi et cant illum. *Omnis enim quicúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-28150b8c-e657-45dd-aff0-b87c2671ba81" facs="#m-15aff286-8124-441a-85c8-660b49c00661" label="lyrics-like">1t Graeci: t nam idem Dóminus que invocáverit nomen Dómini,</l><l xml:id="m-cd9cfa41-062f-4b8a-8ca9-91f38f333507" facs="#m-5daad42f-e0fd-490d-81ae-93d36a44bcf1" label="lyrics-like">ómnium, dives in omnes qui invo¬ salvus erit.</l><l xml:id="m-55a91b00-f814-479a-a283-f9c9ab8d9371" facs="#m-a3fe13e4-f6ba-4b7f-a4ce-329b35a29adb" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Constitues éos. p. 1113. V. Nimis honoráti sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-1bc8cda5-c4aa-4512-b18e-6266c606d3a4" facs="#m-23bc56c9-30ca-4cd5-96e8-1de6b3a842fd" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-a0b33ec3-4235-4997-82ef-028732f78f92" facs="#m-e4bfd24c-d9a8-4796-addb-f3493159c501" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Qui persequebántur jústum. p. 1308.</l><l xml:id="m-5e904483-e80c-4417-bdba-efe9802097d1" facs="#m-6aa8c85e-c3df-453d-9e31-2208c0b29a4c" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-d9bd899d-2400-4fd7-9a91-bc08591560ed" facs="#m-6772657c-3448-4731-aacb-fb7e3cb0713a" label="ambiguous">Rom. 10. c.</l><l xml:id="m-09b741c4-7dc6-4451-8ad2-effb0845629b" facs="#m-1f722e16-f99e-4e6a-bb2a-58a8c3366abd" label="lyrics-like">"Saias enim dicit: Dómine, quis quid non audiérunt? Et quidem in</l><l xml:id="m-c16f45fe-8795-41e7-ad69-e88c9f12a750" facs="#m-c7b4487e-e666-4ed4-a32c-8ddc52635501" label="lyrics-like">L crédidit auditui nostro? Ergo omnem terram exivit sonus eórum."</l><l xml:id="m-381610de-4060-4d00-8cb1-098d75d25105" facs="#m-091a95fa-5fc9-4c9b-ad04-158804c863de" label="lyrics-like">fides ex auditu, audítus autem per et in fines orbis terrae verba eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-39e413c0-6017-4e65-81a7-b4e84e111378" facs="#m-048ac6ef-1ef7-4068-8ed5-974797745b7e" label="ambiguous">verbum Christi. f Sed dico: Num¬</l><l xml:id="m-d5caeb5d-9688-4d06-ac1e-ddf2a18902be" facs="#m-4caf6574-e9f1-4e11-a89b-444bc742b3cc" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Nimis honoráti sunt. p. 1114. V. Annuntiavérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-41797765-261a-4fbf-a0e5-6da136daddbc" facs="#m-d02698e6-c57e-4d38-a424-7ce7504e9069" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-cd2123db-a58e-485e-87a2-55c55559c785" facs="#m-0b64bcbc-1602-4d2b-9537-895e44a30b65" label="lyrics-like">Psalms of first Vespers. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 7. C. D. 132. — 2. Confi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ee11029a-aab0-40d5-b128-74d78abb9ed3" facs="#m-a78429bb-85cd-447f-b640-671348c60cb7" label="lyrics-like">tébor. 8. G. p. 140. — 3. Beátus vir. 8. G. p. 147. — 4. Laudáte púeri.</l><l xml:id="m-2ce399d5-1823-4bf3-b1a8-e390aca4b9d4" facs="#m-0649af17-0bf6-4c4f-8721-0f67042f1c2f" label="lyrics-like">8. G. p. 152. — 5. Laudáte Dóminum. 7. a. p. 168.</l><l xml:id="m-05ca478c-16bb-4e47-aacd-3a4e239b2d50" facs="#m-a2f5807e-df2c-43d3-af5e-4d5fceddce25" label="lyrics-like">Psalms of second Vespers. 1. Dixit Dóminus, 7. c. p. 132. — 2. Lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-72c7a746-f6f0-4778-adc7-c51ffd700fc5" facs="#m-3e45dc2e-57ee-4bba-8e60-fce2dce09447" label="lyrics-like">dáte púeri. 8. G. p. 152.— 3. Crédidi. 8. G. p. 165. — 4. In converténdo.</l><l xml:id="m-e02cde26-fed6-43ed-8987-c1863485283a" facs="#m-d8de1b67-2a67-48ff-aad6-44700194c3a8" label="lyrics-like">8. G. p. 175.— 5. Dómine probásti me. 7. a. p. 188.</l><l xml:id="m-2baec123-0f76-4841-9dc4-6cce0bf7108a" facs="#m-adbc1af6-d167-41fb-a9c1-f81c8e7122ad" label="ambiguous">1.Ant.E</l><l xml:id="m-d9387e22-6d54-4d29-864f-2fc386bb98d6" facs="#m-bacb4acf-df26-4121-98c2-06f023d50025" label="ambiguous">7.e</l><l xml:id="m-03bf6fa4-42d0-4c39-bab2-c87b01926ab9" facs="#m-0133a08c-5167-40ee-9791-b8d15bc09a7c" label="lyrics-like">Alve Crux pre-ti-ósa, “súscipe discípulum é jus</l><l xml:id="m-3e8870a6-eab3-44fc-ab68-da02ee637d70" facs="#m-3eb396e3-3b36-4eec-ad11-b4aedd0145b6" label="lyrics-like">qui pepéndit in te, magíster mé-us Christus. Eu o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-af014413-5cbc-4f9f-a6b1-8ca7309c1d60" facs="#m-6f62f990-aab3-438c-9136-57ac71ed3e3b" label="ambiguous">2. Ant.;</l><l xml:id="m-95771f37-2ffe-40b2-855d-5187ec484514" facs="#m-ff9f0f2b-705d-4cd2-9607-9f465fba067e" label="ambiguous">8.G</l><l xml:id="m-3bf9f0e4-14ca-4a93-bbf1-ee2af5ae905c" facs="#m-535a7473-0491-4781-a2b0-999283affdb1" label="lyrics-like">D E-átus André-as" orábat dícens: Dó-mine, Rex</l><l xml:id="m-f3cd70f3-522d-4547-8f93-46b2fd68396b" facs="#m-2f1b6ca0-28f4-494f-80e6-14a244e227e8" label="lyrics-like">pendéntem in pa-tíbu-lo.</l><l xml:id="m-7cd5b458-afb8-413a-ab00-869a0b6d17f1" facs="#m-eabba311-7642-482f-8049-104e5c553de4" label="lyrics-like">actérnae gló-ri-ae, súscipe me</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
